  {
    "slug": "markalarimiz",
    "title": "Our Brands",
    "image": "img-bg.webp",
    "content": [
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Ergen Tekstil proudly presents: FORMActive, a brand designed specifically for everyone who embraces an active lifestyle. The pioneering and innovative spirit of Ergen Tekstil, founded in 2004, can be felt in every FORMActive product."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "FORMActive stands out with its modern design and superior comfort. It has become the go-to choice for athletes and those with an active lifestyle, offering a wide product range including leggings, bustiers, shorts, sets and jumpsuits, with solutions suited to every body."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "One of the standout features of our brand is our shaping seamless leggings. They support your body while boosting your performance, allowing for comfortable movement."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "FORMActive is not just a garment — it's a lifestyle. Every product combines Ergen Tekstil's quality and innovation to deliver the best possible experience to our customers."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "For active sports enthusiasts, FORMActive is ready to accompany you everywhere, from the gym to the streets. Backed by Ergen Tekstil, we're here to give you excellent support at every step."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "slug": "uretimde-mukemmellik-ergen-tekstilin-kalite-standartlari",
    "title": "Excellence in Production: Ergen Tekstil's Quality Standards",
    "image": "uretim-1.webp",
    "content": [
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "At Ergen Tekstil, we place great importance on manufacturing our products to the highest quality standards. That's why we carry out meticulous checks and monitoring at every stage of the production process."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Our quality control processes are as follows:"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Raw Material Inspection: The raw materials used in production are checked to ensure they meet the highest quality standards."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Production Inspection: Every stage of the production process is inspected and faulty products are eliminated."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Final Product Inspection: Once completed, products undergo one final inspection before being packaged."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Thanks to Ergen Tekstil's rigorous quality control processes, we take pride in always offering our customers products of the highest quality. Our products are built to last and come with a full satisfaction guarantee for our customers."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "slug": "surdurulebilir-modaya-adim-adim-ergen-tekstilin-cevre-dostu-yaklasimi",
    "title": "Step by Step Toward Sustainable Fashion: Ergen Tekstil's Eco-Friendly Approach",
    "image": "aa.webp",
    "content": [
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The textile industry is known as one of the most polluting sectors in the world. Aware of this reality, Ergen Tekstil has embraced the principles of sustainable fashion to leave future generations a liveable world."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "As part of our sustainable fashion approach, we take the following steps:"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Use of recycled materials: We use recycled materials in our products wherever possible."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Energy and water savings: We take care to save energy and water throughout our production processes."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Reducing chemical use: We avoid using chemicals that are harmful to the environment and human health."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Waste management: We work to recycle or minimise the waste generated by production."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "At Ergen Tekstil, we are committed to doing our part for sustainable fashion. Through our environmentally conscious approach to production, we want to both set an example for the industry and leave a liveable world for future generations."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "slug": "dikissiz-teknolojinin-gucu-formactive-ile-tanisin",
    "title": "The Power of Seamless Technology: Meet FORMactive",
    "image": "formactive-tanitim.webp",
    "content": [
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Seamless clothing has sparked a true revolution in sportswear and shapewear in recent years. Offering comfort, flexibility and performance, seamless products have become the ideal choice for athletes and anyone seeking everyday comfort."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "At Ergen Tekstil, we take pride in being one of the pioneers of seamless clothing technology. Under our FORMactive brand, we use the latest technology to manufacture the highest quality seamless products."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Some of the standout features of FORMactive products include:"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Comfort: Thanks to the seamless construction, products fit the body perfectly and allow freedom of movement."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Performance: Breathable, non-sweat fabrics help you achieve maximum performance during sport and exercise."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Stylish Design: We offer products in a range of colours and styles to suit every taste."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Choose FORMactive products to experience the comfort and performance that seamless technology has to offer. Enjoy the highest quality seamless products, backed by the assurance of Ergen Tekstil."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "slug": "ergen-tekstilin-yenilikci-urun-tasarimlari",
    "title": "Ergen Tekstil's Innovative Product Designs",
    "image": "side-1.webp",
    "content": [
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Our design team draws inspiration from every corner of the world. They follow fashion trends, study different cultures and analyse consumer needs. With this knowledge, they create original and innovative product designs."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The core stages of Ergen Tekstil's design process are as follows:"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Trend Research: Our design team researches and analyses the trends of each season."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Concept Development: Different concepts are developed based on the trends identified."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Design Sketching: Once concepts are finalised, design sketches and prototypes are prepared."
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Production: Once prototypes are approved, products move into production."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Ergen Tekstil always aims to stay one step ahead with innovative product designs. Through our design team's meticulous work and creative perspective, we continue to offer our customers the latest trends and the highest quality."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "slug": "ergen-tekstilden-fuar-haberleri-istanbulda-moda-bulusmasi",
    "title": "Trade Fair News from Ergen Tekstil: A Fashion Gathering in Istanbul",
    "image": "Fuar-Blog.webp",
    "content": [
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Istanbul Fashion Connection Fair Concludes Successfully!"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Held in Istanbul from 7 to 10 February 2024, the Istanbul Fashion Connection Fair was an important meeting point for the ready-to-wear industry. As Ergen Tekstil, we were delighted to take part in this exciting fair and to connect with leading names in the industry."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Highlights of the Fair:"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Held across a 35,000 square metre area"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Attended by over 300 companies and thousands of buyers"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Participants came from EU countries, Russia, Ukraine, the US and many other countries"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Products were showcased across many categories, including women's and men's wear, baby and children's wear, sportswear, underwear, leather and fur clothing, and footwear"
      },
      {
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Trend areas, seminars, workshops and fashion shows covered current topics such as digital transformation, smart clothing, technical textiles and sustainability"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Ergen Tekstil's Take on the Fair:"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "At our dedicated stand, we showcased samples from our latest collections and innovative products. We exchanged detailed information about our products with visitors and formed new business connections. Our FORMactive brand's seamless sportswear and shapewear products in particular drew strong interest."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "We believe the fair was an excellent platform both for keeping up with industry developments and for meeting new customers. By continuing to take part in upcoming fairs, we aim to strengthen our position in the global market even further."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Our Sustainable Fashion Vision:"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "At Ergen Tekstil, we place great importance on the principles of sustainable fashion. We use environmentally conscious methods in our production processes and prefer recycled materials. During the fair, we also took part in seminars and panels on sustainable fashion, contributing to raising awareness on the subject."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Ergen Tekstil's Plans After the Fair:"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "We will continue our work to maintain the momentum we gained at the Istanbul Fashion Connection Fair. We will keep investing in new product development and innovation, and continue taking part in international fairs and events to play an even more active role in the global market."
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Stay Connected with Ergen Tekstil:"
      },
      {
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Follow our website and social media accounts to stay up to date with our latest news and products."
      }
    ]
  },
